{"type": "sena", "labs": [{"stimuli": [{"template_override": 1, "type": "welcome", "_data": [], "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [], "type": "audio", "title": "", "contents": [{"type": "slideshow", "value": {"audiosrc": "engenn7le01ob07re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn7le01ob07re2img01.jpg", "images": [{"image": "engenn7le01ob07re2img01.jpg", "text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0"}, {"image": "engenn7le01ob07re2img01.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Hey Bob, that looks like a nice bagel. Where did you get it?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>:        I bought it at New England Bagels. It's the best bagel I've ever had in town.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Yeah, they're pretty tasty, but they don't beat New York bagels. I had so many the last time I was in Manhattan. They're just so ... chewy!", "id": 1, "time": "100"}, {"image": "engenn7le01ob07re2img02.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>:        Actually, if you want my opinion as a baker, the absolute best bagels you'll ever eat are in Montreal. Nothing comes close! I've tried every single bagel shop over the years.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Wow, that's dedication. Do you know what makes them so special?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>:        They dip the bagels in honey. Then, they boil them for about two minutes before baking them. That's what gives them their unique texture and flavor.", "id": 2, "time": "20750"}, {"image": "engenn7le01ob07re2img05.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    So Montreal has great jazz and great bakeries. I can't believe I've never been there yet!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bob</span>:        Oh, you would love it. They have amazing French bistros, excellent breweries and the nightlife beats Boston's hands down. In my opinion, it's the most fun city I've visited so far.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>:    Sounds like the perfect weekend getaway with Marco ... Can you tell me where I can find these bagels then?", "id": 3, "time": "48000"}]}}], "id": 1}], "exercises": [{"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " I can talk about food, drink, and social activities.", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can ask questions about food, drink, and social activities. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " I can talk about people's past experiences. ", "type": "Learning Outcomes"}, {"content": " Have you already had a bagel?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " Do you know where bagels originally come from?", "type": "Free Header Item"}, {"content": " What kind of food is typical of your country?", "type": "Free Header Item"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Welcome", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "try again", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "You have 2 tries", "type": "text"}, {"content": "you have 1 attempt left", "type": "text"}]}, "type": "feedback"}, {"content": " Ask your partner:", "type": "free_header_text"}, {"content": " Let's embark on a quest for the best bagel in the world!", "type": "free_type_text_area"}], "img_path": "", "questions": [], "type": "WLC", "id": 0, "stimuli_ids": [0]}, {"template_override": 1, "_data": [{"type": "instructions", "contents": [{"content": " \nVanessa gets a <span class=\"tool-tip\" id=\"tip_1_0\">crash course</span> on bagel making by Bob the baker.\n", "type": "text"}]}, {"type": "group", "contents": [{"content": "Content", "type": "group_name"}]}, {"content": {"allowed_attempts": 2, "incorrect_feedback": [{"content": "Whoops! Something important is missing.", "type": "text"}, {"content": "Maybe next time...", "type": "text"}], "correct_feedback": "Correct!", "attempt_feedback": [{"content": "", "type": "text"}, {"content": ""